        "original_id": "4350447c-77ef-5368-8c82-2c87db65d800",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lee Jong-suk, Han Hyo-joo, Yoo Jun-sang, Kim Eui-sung\n- Works: School 2013, I Can Hear Your Voice, Doctor Stranger, Pinocchio, W\n- Events: 2012 KBS Drama Awards\n- Topics: South Korean actors, models, television series\n\nFacts:\n- Lee Jong-suk was born on 14 September 1989 and is a South Korean actor and model.\n- Lee Jong-suk's breakout role was in \"School 2013\" in 2012.\n- The 2012 KBS Drama Awards was held on December 31, 2012, and Yoo Jun-sang and Lee Jong-suk hosted the event.\n- Lee Jong-suk was also known for his role in \"I Can Hear Your Voice\" in 2013.\n- Lee Jong-suk was also known for roles in \"Doctor Stranger\" and \"Pinocchio\" in 2014.\n- \"W\" is a 2016 South Korean television series starring Lee Jong-suk and Han Hyo-joo.\n- Kim Eui-sung appears in the 2016 TV series \"W\".\n- Lee Jong-suk was also well known for his role in \"W\" in 2016.",
